---
---
<section class="py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-container mx-auto">

    <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-[#212840] bg-[#0D1020] overflow-hidden px-8 sm:px-16 py-16 sm:py-20 text-center" style="box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(99,102,241,0.06);">

      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] opacity-60 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(99,102,241,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>

      <div data-animate class="mb-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#6366F1]/8 border border-[#6366F1]/15 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#818CF8]">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          Free to start. No credit card required.
        </span>
      </div>

      <h2 data-animate data-delay="1" class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#E8EEFF] leading-tight max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Your next application should feel organized.
      </h2>

      <p data-animate data-delay="2" class="mt-5 text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] text-[#7B82AF] max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Start with one job description. DevTrack turns it into a structured workflow — parsed, scored, tracked, and followed up.
      </p>

      <div data-animate data-delay="3" class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#6366F1] hover:bg-[#5558E8] text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center shadow-[0_0_32px_rgba(99,102,241,0.35)]">
          Start free
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#131828] hover:bg-[#1A1E32] border border-[#212840] hover:border-[#2e3658] text-[#E8EEFF] text-sm font-medium rounded-xl transition-all duration-150 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
          See how it works
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
